'''Blue''' (Japanese: '''グリーン''' ''Green'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=During your opponent's next turn, all of your Pokémon take −10 damage from attacks from your opponent's Pokémon.
}}

