==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to {{TCG|Jasmine's Gaze}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but decreases damage by 10 instead of 30.
** This card's effect is also similar to the Item card {{TCG|Defender}} in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but as a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} that applies to all Pokémon instead of an {{TCGP|Item card}} that attaches to a specific Pokémon, and decreases damage by 10 instead of 20.

===Origin===
*{{ga|Blue}} is the [[rival]] of the {{player}} and the {{pkmn|Champion}} in Generations {{gen|I}} and {{gen|III}}. The interior of the [[Indigo Plateau]]'s champion room, as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}, is featured in the illustration.

